cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it."
title: "MetaTrader Broker Symbols: measured symbol names, server-time offsets and lot rules across 241 MT4/MT5 brokers"
abstract: >-
  A cross-broker lookup table of MetaTrader instrument symbol names, read
  directly from live MT4 and MT5 trading servers rather than transcribed from
  broker documentation. Covers 241 brokers and 96 instruments, with 13,777
  measured symbol names, 240 measured server-time (GMT) offsets, and per-symbol
  digits, contract size, minimum lot and lot step where the server reported
  them. Addresses the practical problem that the same instrument carries a
  different symbol string on nearly every broker, which silently breaks
  automated trading systems ported between them.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "metatraderVPS"
    website: "https://metatrader-vps.com"
